	(text "C3: Land pattern is set by the 10 mm can diameter; the can is 16.5 mm tall, so confirm the pad layout against Panasonic's drawing.\nU1: PLLIN/MODE to INTVCC selects forced continuous conduction, which is what the model assumes. ILIM to INTVCC sets a 50 mV current limit. EXTVCC from +5V.\nR10: Linear interpolation between the data sheet's characterised points (65k gives 440 kHz, 105k gives 835 kHz). Confirm against its frequency curve.\nD2 PMEG6010CEH: Bootstrap diode, 60 V Schottky. The data sheet calls for one between INTVCC and BOOST\nC14 100nF: Bootstrap capacitor, 0.1 uF 50 V\nC15 4.7uF: INTVCC decoupling. Data sheet minimum 2.2 uF\nC16 100nF: VIN pin bypass to SGND\nC17 47nF: Soft start. tSS = CSS * 0.8 V / 10 uA = 3.8 ms\nR10 71.5k: Frequency set, 500 kHz\nR11 1M: RUN divider top. Starts at about 7 V rising\nR12 210k: RUN divider bottom. 1.21 V threshold, 6.3 V at 36 V in"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 223.52 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f4b5634a-6643-5d22-8723-ae0f160f5779")
	)
